## Summary

Single change in `src/views/ChatView.vue`, everything else byte-identical to the current file.

| Zone | Before | After |
|---|---|---|
| Settings modal | `<modal v-if="showTaskSettings">` with no header, no `close` → no X, no Escape | `close` + `@close` (X and Escape wired through `Modal.vue`), `header` slot printing `Chat properties` and `board / column · id` |
| `TaskSettings` | `:taskData` + `@close` | same plus `hideHeader`, so the child does not print a second header bar |

`Modal.vue` renders the header only when a `title` prop or `header` slot exists (`hasHeader()`), and only shows the X when `close` is true — both conditions are now satisfied, and `bodyClass()` switches to even padding because the header exists.
